Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This is an independent Go implementation of a KNOBE Protocol v1 verifier.
Its behavior follows the reference verifier lens.py from
https://github.com/KnobeOne/knobe-protocol (Apache-2.0, David Kyle,
UC Davis). No upstream source code is included. The test suite reads the
upstream test vectors (CC0-1.0) from a separate checkout at test time.

It depends on golang.org/x/text (BSD-3-Clause) for Unicode NFC normalization.
